### =====================
### Books
### =====================

### Get all books
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books
Accept: application/json

### Get all books with title filter
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books?titleKeyWord=test
Accept: application/json

### Get one book by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/1
Accept: application/json

### Get authors for a book
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/1/authors
Accept: application/json

### =====================
### Genres
### =====================

### Get all genres
GET http://localhost:8080/api/genres
Accept: application/json
